ORGANISER AND MC200/400 DIARY CONVERSION CODE TO PORT DIARIES TO SERIES3 
========================================================================

ORG2AGN and MC2AGN convert ORGANISER LZ and MC400 Diary files respectively
to Series 3 Agenda file format.

ORG2AGN.OPL converts saved Organizer LZ diaries in text format. By default
the Organiser file is expected to be in directory \ODB\ on the Series 3
and to have extension .ODB (as generated by sending the diary to a PC using
CL.EXE).

MC2AGN.OPL converts ordinary MC400 diaries. By default the MC400 diary is 
expected to be in directory \DRY\ on the Series 3 and to have .DRY extension.

If you set 'Verbose' in the dialog presented, the programs display the records
as they are converted, which is a lot slower.
